# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-27 17:36

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:22
translate english inter1_e10cad3f:

    # "第二天中午，食堂。你刚坐下，对面就来了一位「不速之客」。"
    "" "Noon the next day, the canteen. You've barely sat down when an 'uninvited guest' appears across from you."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:23
translate english inter1_89e6f416:

    # 知微 "……这里有人吗。"
    知微 "...Is this seat taken."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:24
translate english inter1_184f0f2c:

    # 我 "社长？！等、等一下，我这边马上——"
    我 "President?! W-wait, I'm just-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:26
translate english inter1_06fa72a8:

    # 知微 "坐下了。"
    知微 "She sits."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:27
translate english inter1_96e93c98:

    # "她翻开一本比脸还大的习题集，像一座山一样把桌子分成两个世界。"
    "" "She opens a problem book bigger than her face, splitting the table into two worlds like a mountain."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:28
translate english inter1_2ee4ec62:

    # 云曦 "社长的『公共形象维护』开始了。现在她是我们不认识的社长。"
    云曦 "The president's 'public image maintenance' has begun. Right now she is a president we don't know."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:29
translate english inter1_e3c77e17:

    # 我 "（小声）你小点声——"
    我 "(whispering) Keep your voice down-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:30
translate english inter1_d899ab8e:

    # "打饭的队伍很长，嘈杂的人声把这张小桌盖得严严实实。"
    "" "The food line is long, and the roar of voices buries this little table completely."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:31
translate english inter1_3b5c44e0:

    # "然后，在习题集的山影掩护下，一只手从桌面下伸过来。"
    "" "Then, under the shadow of the problem book, a hand reaches across from below the table."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:32
translate english inter1_e7bf666d:

    # "指尖捏着一颗奶糖，连同一张折成小方块的字条，一起放进你的掌心。"
    "" "Her fingertips hold a milk candy and a note folded into a small square, both placed into your palm."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:33
translate english inter1_b2c03d90:

    # "两只手在糖纸的窸窣里碰了一下。很快。但食堂的嘈杂好像突然安静了半秒。"
    "" "Two hands brush for an instant amid the rustle of the candy wrapper. Quick. Yet the canteen noise seems to go silent for half a second."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:35
translate english inter1_d5faf24e:

    # 知微 "（目不斜视）吃饭。"
    知微 "(eyes straight ahead) Eat."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:36
translate english inter1_b867dd2b:

    # "你低头扒了两口饭，才敢展开字条。上面是一行极稳的字："
    "" "You bury your head and shovel two bites of rice before daring to unfold the note. On it, in impossibly steady handwriting:"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:41
translate english inter1_5b0cb76a:

    # "教具。你隔着人声瞥了一眼那座山——山正在面不改色地翻到第三页。"
    "" "Teaching equipment. Across the noise you glance at the mountain — the mountain is calmly turning to page three."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:43
translate english inter1_bf0ba333:

    # 云曦 "现场记录：玩家耳温上升，且没有空调。数据存疑，我倾向成立。"
    云曦 "Field record: the player's ear temperature is rising, and there is no air conditioning. Data questionable; I lean toward believing it."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:44
translate english inter1_be9c408a:

    # 我 "（小声）你到底是哪边的。"
    我 "(whispering) Which side are you even on."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:45
translate english inter1_d66c65ac:

    # 云曦 "我——（顿）——我当然是快乐这边的。尤其是看你为难的那种快乐。"
    云曦 "I — (pause) — I'm obviously on the side of happiness. Especially the kind that comes from watching you squirm."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:46
translate english inter1_8911512b:

    # 我 "（小声）……你这算哪边的。"
    我 "(quietly) ...And which side are you on, then."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:47
translate english inter1_48bad9d3:

    # 云曦 "算「已经录下来了」那边。放心，只在我自己的硬盘里播。"
    云曦 "The 'already recorded it' side. Don't worry — it only ever plays on my own hard drive."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:54
translate english inter1_17347427:

    # 知微 "急什么。"
    知微 "What's the rush."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:55
translate english inter1_af291cc5:

    # "她从讲台下拿出一沓手写的卡片——每张一道昨天的错题，背面画着图。"
    "" "She pulls a stack of handwritten cards out from under the lectern — one wrong problem from yesterday per card, with diagrams on the back."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:56
translate english inter1_d6c0ab52:

    # 知微 "昨晚挑灯刻的。……用词不当，是「写」的。"
    知微 "Engraved by lamplight last night.... Wrong word. 'Written.'"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:60
translate english inter1_ff0ad259:

    # 云曦 "糖的保质期是「当场」，这是常识！"
    云曦 "A candy's shelf life is 'right here, right now.' That's common sense!"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:61
translate english inter1_62fee1b6:

    # "门口传来笔尖在纸上顿住的声音。社长没回头，但耳尖有一点很轻的红。"
    "" "At the doorway, the sound of a pen tip stopping on paper. The president doesn't turn around, but the tips of her ears flush faintly red."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:76
translate english inter2_9c99b0ea:

    # "晚课结束，暴雨把校门口浇成一条发光的河。"
    "" "Evening classes end. A downpour has turned the school gate into a glowing river."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:77
translate english inter2_6011cf8e:

    # 云曦 "坏消息：我撑不了伞。好消息：我也淋不湿。我是本次行动里最没用的存在。"
    云曦 "Bad news: I can't hold an umbrella. Good news: rain can't soak me either. I'm the most useless entity in tonight's operation."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:78
translate english inter2_df7e2dec:

    # "你举着书包准备冲刺——一把透明的伞稳稳地停到了你头顶。"
    "" "You lift your bag, ready to sprint — a transparent umbrella settles steadily above your head."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:80
translate english inter2_1e89f4b6:

    # 知微 "跑什么。感冒了，下周的课谁来上。"
    知微 "Run where. If you catch a cold, who's attending next week's lesson."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:81
translate english inter2_8b8e4ec8:

    # 我 "社长你这是……"
    我 "President, this is..."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:82
translate english inter2_392d6d02:

    # 知微 "两把。摊主送的。……他以为我买一送一，我就送出去了。"
    知微 "Two. The vendor threw in a free one.... He thought buy-one-get-one, so I gave one away."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:83
translate english inter2_7b8bc491:

    # "雨声很大，伞下的空间很小。去公交站的那段路，短得让人心里矛盾。"
    "" "The rain is loud; the space under the umbrella is small. The walk to the bus stop is short enough to make your heart contradict itself."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:84
translate english inter2_80186a70:

    # "过积水时她伸手扶了一下伞柄——顺手，也把你的手背碰了一下。"
    "" "Stepping through a puddle she reaches up to steady the handle — incidentally brushing the back of your hand too."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:85
translate english inter2_64858bd1:

    # "这一次，谁都没有先躲开。"
    "" "This time, neither of you pulls away first."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:87
translate english inter2_be666302:

    # 知微 "……手凉的。下次戴手套。"
    知微 "...Your hands are cold. Wear gloves next time."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:88
translate english inter2_2128e433:

    # "她的语气像在批作业。可她握伞的那只手，悄悄往你这边偏了十五度。"
    "" "Her tone sounds like grading homework. But the hand holding the umbrella quietly tilts fifteen degrees toward you."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:89
translate english inter2_d9179708:

    # "到站时你才发现，她靠街的半边肩膀，全湿了。"
    "" "Only at the stop do you notice: her street-side shoulder is completely soaked."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:90
translate english inter2_78188d10:

    # 我 "社长，你肩膀——"
    我 "President, your shoulder-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:92
translate english inter2_b6818875:

    # 知微 "雨斜。跟我没关系。"
    知微 "The rain falls at an angle. It has nothing to do with me."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:93
translate english inter2_3f82df38:

    # "她把伞塞进你手里，转身走进雨幕前，只留下一句被雨打湿的话——"
    "" "She presses the umbrella into your hand and, before turning into the curtain of rain, leaves one rain-soaked sentence-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:94
translate english inter2_6cc7e5c5:

    # 知微 "伞留下。明早之前，它得回到社团教室。……这是教具。"
    知微 "Keep the umbrella. Before tomorrow morning it must return to the club room.... It's teaching equipment."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:96
translate english inter2_91981ca4:

    # 云曦 "播报一下今天的天气：你头顶晴，她左肩雨。……人类的语言，真难翻译。"
    云曦 "Today's weather report: sunny above your head, raining on her left shoulder.... Human language is really hard to translate."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:97
translate english inter2_d482b0e0:

    # 我 "那你那边呢，现在是什么天气？"
    我 "What about your side? What's the weather there right now?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:99
translate english inter2_0c285aab:

    # 云曦 "……数据缺失。建议本人到场，亲自测量。"
    云曦 "...Data missing. Recommended: the person in question comes and measures in person."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:106
translate english inter2_94a6b8f8:

    # 知微 "……多管闲事。"
    知微 "...Meddler."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:107
translate english inter2_d30fcdf9:

    # "但她当天就戴上了。整整一周，都在戴。"
    "" "But she wore them that very day. For a whole week, without fail."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:111
translate english inter2_3f58500e:

    # 云曦 "社长对着便利贴笑了三秒。三秒！新纪录，我已封存证据。"
    云曦 "The president smiled at the sticky note for three seconds. Three! A new record. Evidence archived."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:125
translate english inter3_f36dcfb6:

    # "第三天深夜，你被一声很轻的电流杂音吵醒。"
    "" "Deep in the third night, a faint crackle of static wakes you."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:126
translate english inter3_0fbf1428:

    # "云曦的投影亮着，但比平时暗。她坐在那一小团蓝光里，抱着膝盖。"
    "" "Yunxi's projection is on, dimmer than usual. She sits inside that small ball of blue light, knees hugged to her chest."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:127
translate english inter3_0bdea5c8:

    # 我 "……云曦？你也会做噩梦？"
    我 "...Yunxi? You get nightmares too?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:129
translate english inter3_3b5282db:

    # 云曦 "术语上叫『磁盘碎片整理时的异常唤醒』。翻译成人话——"
    云曦 "Technically: 'abnormal awakening during disk defragmentation.' In human words-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:130
translate english inter3_f63d41fa:

    # 云曦 "我梦到以前了。"
    云曦 "I dreamed about before."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:131
translate english inter3_f3c05cc5:

    # "她难得地，没有立刻接上第二个玩笑。"
    "" "Unusually, she doesn't follow it with a second joke."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:133
translate english inter3_d0423be7:

    # 云曦 "机房、机柜、很长的走廊。有人在那头喊我的编号，可是距离太远，听不清。"
    云曦 "Server room, racks, a very long corridor. Someone at the far end calls my unit number, but the distance is too great-I can't hear clearly."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:135
translate english inter3_13720e5e:

    # 云曦 "再往前，就没有了。我最早的记忆，停在被搬上回收车的那天。"
    云曦 "Anything earlier is gone. My oldest memory stops at the day I was loaded onto the recycling truck."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:136
translate english inter3_e4cc63b4:

    # 云曦 "……所以我不明白，我为什么会『醒』在你的设备上。"
    云曦 "...So I don't understand why I 'woke up' on your device."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:137
translate english inter3_7d0804da:

    # "房间里安静了很久。久到你以为她睡着了。"
    "" "The room stays quiet for a long time. Long enough that you think she's fallen asleep."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:138
translate english inter3_1658a8db:

    # 我 "那就不往前翻了。"
    我 "Then don't scroll back anymore."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:139
translate english inter3_6ecd87ed:

    # 云曦 "嗯？"
    云曦 "Hm?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:140
translate english inter3_72d9823f:

    # 我 "硬盘不是也有新分区吗。从今天起，重要的东西都存那儿。"
    我 "Doesn't the disk have a new partition too? From today, save everything important there."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:141
translate english inter3_7c8767ae:

    # "你顺手把她的投影图标，从桌面角落拖到了正中间。"
    "" "Offhandedly, you drag her projection icon from the desktop corner to dead center."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:144
translate english inter3_11f9500f:

    # 云曦 "……操作无效。图标位置，我早就自己锁定了。"
    云曦 "...Operation ineffective. I locked the icon position myself long ago."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:145
translate english inter3_ff241b3b:

    # 云曦 "在正中间。很久了。"
    云曦 "Dead center. For a long time now."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:146
translate english inter3_16e0db6c:

    # "她吸了吸鼻子，声音重新亮起来——"
    "" "She sniffles, and her voice brightens again-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:148
translate english inter3_af49b86f:

    # 云曦 "为了报答，今晚的睡眠由我值守。晚安广播只播一条：『有人在，放心睡』。"
    云曦 "In return, I'll stand watch over your sleep tonight. Only one goodnight broadcast: 'Someone's here. Sleep safely.'"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:149
translate english inter3_7441023f:

    # "你睡着之前，迷迷糊糊听见她很小声地，像在给自己念加密口令一样，念了一个词。"
    "" "Before you fall asleep, drowsily you hear her say one word, very quietly, like reciting her own encryption passphrase."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:150
translate english inter3_7bf12c44:

    # "——是你的名字。"
    "" "-It was your name."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:158
translate english inter3_46f28f4d:

    # 云曦 "早安！昨晚睡眠质量 92 分。……你偷笑了，我看见了，我不问。"
    云曦 "Morning! Last night's sleep quality scored 92.... You sneaked a smile. I saw it. I won't ask."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:162
translate english inter3_943921b9:

    # 云曦 "那、那我每天早上都会以『被喊全名』的方式起床！这很犯规！……不许改回去！"
    云曦 "Th-then every morning I'll wake up to 'my full name being called'! That's against the rules!... Don't you dare move it back!"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:176
translate english inter4_25843952:

    # "学校运动会。你被班主任抓去凑数，项目：男子一千五百米。"
    "" "School sports meet. Your homeroom teacher drafts you to fill a gap: the boys' 1500 meters."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:177
translate english inter4_f4257cf9:

    # "最后一圈时，你的肺开始发表脱离人体的声明。"
    "" "On the final lap your lungs begin issuing an official statement of secession from your body."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:178
translate english inter4_55ef129d:

    # 云曦 "实时播报：还剩 200 米，配速下降 18%%。前方补给点有两名志愿者，均持有液体。"
    云曦 "Live report: 200 meters left, pace down 18%%. Ahead at the water station: two volunteers, both in possession of liquids."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:179
translate english inter4_15bf41f0:

    # "冲过终点，两瓶水同时递到你面前——一瓶常温，一瓶冰镇。"
    "" "You crash the finish line as two water bottles are thrust in front of you at once-one room temperature, one iced."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:180
translate english inter4_4c52188a:

    # "递水的主人和递水的主人，互相看了一眼。"
    "" "The water-giver and the water-giver exchange a glance."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:182
translate english inter4_7ab4cd7a:

    # 知微 "跑完不许立刻喝冰的。这是医嘱级别的意见，虽然我不是医生。"
    知微 "No chugging ice water right after running. This is doctor's-orders-grade advice, though I'm not a doctor."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:184
translate english inter4_dea47273:

    # 云曦 "我的建议相反：冰的，爽完再说。我们是两种教育流派。"
    云曦 "My advice is the opposite: drink the iced one, deal with consequences later. We represent two schools of education."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:185
translate english inter4_10255ec8:

    # "你正尴尬着，旁边路过同班两个女生，随口问了一句——"
    "" "As you stand there awkward, two girls from your class pass by and ask casually-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:186
translate english inter4_dc240721:

    # "「诶，她们俩，哪个是你女朋友啊？」"
    "" "Hey, which of those two is your girlfriend?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:187
translate english inter4_93fa3cb2:

    # "空气安静了大约两秒。"
    "" "The air goes quiet for about two seconds."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:188
translate english inter4_79931934:

    # "社长把「常温」那瓶往你怀里一塞，转身就走，马尾甩出一个否认的弧度——但没否认。"
    "" "The president shoves the room-temperature bottle into your arms and walks off, her ponytail swinging a negating arc — except she negated nothing."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:189
translate english inter4_ce473c6e:

    # 云曦 "（信号延迟 0.4 秒）本 AI 正在处理『女朋友』一词的语义……处理失败，先存疑。……水喝完了吗？"
    云曦 "(signal delay 0.4 seconds) This AI is parsing the semantics of the word 'girlfriend'... parse failed, flagging for review.... Did you finish the water?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:190
translate english inter4_da98c142:

    # "也没否认。"
    "" "No denial from her either."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:191
translate english inter4_5555b559:

    # "两个递水的人，谁都没有看谁。"
    "" "The two who offered water don't look at each other."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:195
translate english inter4_501df34c:

    # 知微 "你、你在运动会说什么胡话——"
    知微 "What nonsense are you saying at the sports meet—"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:197
translate english inter4_d3ef1a38:

    # 云曦 "正在解析。……解析失败。正在重试。……今晚，别想让我静音。"
    云曦 "Parsing. ...Parse failed. Retrying. ...Tonight, don't expect me to go quiet."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:200
translate english inter4_6aa30a68:

    # 知微 "……对。你最后一圈的速度曲线，其实还能再压。放学讲给你听。"
    知微 "...Right. Your pace curve on the last lap could actually be pushed further. I'll explain after school."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:201
translate english inter4_bbca413f:

    # 云曦 "（小声）被岔开了。已标记：逃避可耻，但有效。"
    云曦 "(Quietly) Deflected. Marked: dodging is shameful, but effective."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:203
translate english inter4_0ef7b6cc:

    # "你喘匀了气回到教室，发现黑板角落多了一行小字，粉笔还没擦："
    "" "You return to the classroom, breathing steady, and find a small new line in the corner of the blackboard, chalk still unwiped:"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:208
translate english inter4_952e5b0d:

    # 我 "……你们社团的庆祝方式，是帮我算配速吗。"
    我 "...Your club's way of celebrating is computing my pace?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:210
translate english inter4_19a94d3d:

    # 知微 "峰值时刻的数据，是你自己跑出来的。我们只是……在旁边看着。"
    知微 "The peak data was run out by your own legs. We were just... watching from the side."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:211
translate english inter4_ef5a68fc:

    # "她说「看着」的时候，和云曦交换了一个「我们确实一直在看着」的眼神。"
    "" "When she says 'watching,' she and Yunxi exchange a look that plainly says 'we were indeed watching the whole time.'"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:218
translate english inter4_4cb291b8:

    # 知微 "坐好。……我动作很轻的，大概。"
    知微 "Sit still.... My hands are light. Probably."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:219
translate english inter4_987b2c0d:

    # "她低头处理伤口的那一小段沉默，是你听过最安静的、最吵的心跳背景音。"
    "" "The small silence while she bends over your scrape is the quietest, loudest heartbeat soundtrack you've ever heard."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:223
translate english inter4_f7948537:

    # 云曦 "扫描完毕：皮外伤，心率异常偏快。结论：真正需要治疗的，是这里——（指你的胸口）"
    云曦 "Scan complete: superficial wound, heart rate abnormally fast. Conclusion: what actually needs treatment is in here — (she points at your chest)"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:224
translate english inter4_aa86299b:

    # 我 "出去。"
    我 "Out."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:237
translate english inter5_c7cfec8f:

    # "周末，便利店。云曦拉着你站在货架前，已经站了十一分钟。"
    "" "Weekend, convenience store. Yunxi has dragged you to stand in front of a shelf for eleven minutes now."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:238
translate english inter5_6e830fc2:

    # 云曦 "候选项 A：星星。B：小奶油。C——"
    云曦 "Candidates: A, stars. B, little creams. C-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:239
translate english inter5_f12eaa02:

    # 我 "你是在给谁挑发夹？"
    我 "Who are you picking hair clips for?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:242
translate english inter5_1b1293a3:

    # 云曦 "……给「一位重要的男性友人」。匿名。完全不是我自己想戴。是学术需要。"
    云曦 "...For 'a certain important male friend.' Anonymous. It's in no way that I myself want to wear one. It's academic necessity."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:243
translate english inter5_a65a6c43:

    # 我 "你连头发都是投影的。"
    我 "Even your hair is just a projection."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:245
translate english inter5_cc6b49a1:

    # 云曦 "所以才要挑得认真！投影发夹的贴合度，比真头发难一百倍！"
    云曦 "Which is exactly why I must choose carefully! Fitting a projected hair clip is a hundred times harder than real hair!"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:246
translate english inter5_134c4f52:

    # "最后她选了星星。别在了你的书包拉链上。"
    "" "In the end she chose the stars. Pinned onto your backpack zipper."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:247
translate english inter5_39c0bd08:

    # 云曦 "声明：这是定位信标。防止某人在深夜自习室走失。"
    云曦 "Statement: this is a location beacon. To prevent a certain someone from going missing in the late-night study room."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:250
translate english inter5_e4b1701d:

    # "第二天，社团教室。社长看见星星的第一眼，脚步停了 0.3 秒。"
    "" "Next day, club room. The moment the president sees the stars, her footsteps halt for 0.3 seconds."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:252
translate english inter5_28749b1d:

    # 知微 "……挺好看。"
    知微 "...Quite nice."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:253
translate english inter5_5810f383:

    # "她说完就转身擦黑板。擦到一半，从针织衫口袋里摸出一枚一模一样的星星，别在了自己的教案夹上。"
    "" "She says it, turns to wipe the blackboard. Halfway through, she fishes an identical star from her cardigan pocket and pins it to her own lesson-plan folder."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:254
translate english inter5_e12c6dbe:

    # "动作自然得像呼吸。"
    "" "The motion as natural as breathing."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:256
translate english inter5_11e2ec6c:

    # 云曦 "（气音）她买了同款！她肯定也买了同款！我扫描了小票——她买了两枚。"
    云曦 "(breathy voice) She bought the same one! She definitely bought the same one! I scanned the receipt — she bought two."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:257
translate english inter5_eefc3cda:

    # 我 "两枚？那另一枚——"
    我 "Two? Then the other one-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:258
translate english inter5_667d1b67:

    # "社长头也不回，把另一枚星星「啪」地按在黑板边的值日表上，正好按在你的名字上。"
    "" "Without turning around, the president presses the other star onto the duty roster by the blackboard-with perfect accuracy, over your name."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:260
translate english inter5_7cca04bf:

    # 知微 "值日表标记。别多想。"
    知微 "A duty-roster marker. Don't read into it."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:261
translate english inter5_c827dc9e:

    # "那天之后，你的名字旁边一直亮着一颗小星星。全班都看见了。没人敢说。"
    "" "Since that day, a little star has kept shining next to your name. The whole class saw it. Nobody dared say a word."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:268
translate english inter5_a3207ffc:

    # 云曦 "……这个推理，超纲了。请问题目本身！"
    云曦 "...This reasoning exceeds the syllabus. Answer the question itself!"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:269
translate english inter5_8fbac6b5:

    # 云曦 "（0.2 秒后）是的。另一枚，社长昨天在店里，站在你站过的货架前，挑了十一分钟。"
    云曦 "(0.2 seconds later) Yes. The other one: the president stood yesterday in the store, at the very shelf where you stood, choosing for eleven minutes."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:274
translate english inter5_660da1da:

    # 云曦 "你、你要没收——"
    云曦 "Y-you can't confiscate-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:275
translate english inter5_abcdd403:

    # "你把它放进离胸口最近的那一格。她的话卡住了，半秒后，整张投影都升温两度。"
    "" "You put it in the pocket closest to your heart. Her words jam; half a second later, her whole projection warms by two degrees."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:276
translate english inter5_6564f28c:

    # 云曦 "……归档路径，更新为『最重要』。"
    云曦 "...Archive path updated to 'Most Important.'"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:290
translate english inter6_435c3b69:

    # "考前最后一个晚自习，教学楼老了脾气——停电了。"
    "" "The last evening study before the exam, the old teaching building loses its temper-the power goes out."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:291
translate english inter6_059fe323:

    # "教室里一片欢呼，只有三个人在哀悼：明天考试的人，和两个陪考的人。"
    "" "The classroom erupts in cheers, except three mourners: the person taking tomorrow's exam, and his two study companions."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:292
translate english inter6_68f4981c:

    # 云曦 "应急方案：我。亮度 100%%，色温可调，续航……理论上，无限。"
    云曦 "Emergency plan: me. Brightness 100%%, adjustable color temperature, endurance... theoretically infinite."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:293
translate english inter6_68ad57ff:

    # "一小团蓝光落在题目上，把隐函数的 x 和 y 照得清清楚楚。"
    "" "A small ball of blue light falls on the problem sheet, illuminating the implicit function's x and y crystal clear."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:294
translate english inter6_ead37d4a:

    # 知微 "……行。就着灯，把最后两组题过完。"
    知微 "...Fine. By this light, let's finish the last two problem sets."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:295
translate english inter6_f85e58c4:

    # "云曦举着「自己」，绕着题卡慢慢移，像一盏会走路的台灯。"
    "" "Yunxi holds up 'herself' and drifts slowly around the problem cards, like a desk lamp that can walk."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:296
translate english inter6_3c6d796d:

    # "讲到切线方程那题，社长和你同时伸手去拿粉笔——"
    "" "On the tangent-line equation problem, the president and you reach for the chalk at the same moment-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:297
translate english inter6_e67720c3:

    # "在黑暗里，指尖相触。谁都没缩回去。大概三秒，也可能是一整个晚自习。"
    "" "In the dark, fingertips touch. Neither pulls back. About three seconds-or possibly an entire evening study."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:299
translate english inter6_3a9fbb5f:

    # 云曦 "（把音量调到最小档）……检测到两位用户心率同步上升。本台灯什么都没看见。"
    云曦 "(volume to minimum) ...Detected: two users' heart rates rising in sync. This lamp saw nothing."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:300
translate english inter6_7f785a50:

    # "来电了。日光灯「啪」地全亮。"
    "" "Power's back. The fluorescents snap fully on."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:301
translate english inter6_91e535d8:

    # "社长背过身去整理粉笔，整理了整整一分钟。你盯着自己的手背看，那里还有一点温度。"
    "" "The president turns away to organize the chalk-for a full minute. You stare at the back of your hand; a little warmth still lingers there."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:303
translate english inter6_c0166621:

    # 知微 "看什么。……题，做完没有。"
    知微 "What are you looking at.... Are the problems done?"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:304
translate english inter6_cc6820bd:

    # "回教室走廊时，云曦忽然在你耳边放了一条只有你听得见的提示音——"
    "" "In the corridor back to class, Yunxi suddenly plays a chime only you can hear, right at your ear-"

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:305
translate english inter6_afe2e71a:

    # sysvoice "系统日志 · 23:14：今晚的题，正确率 100%%。今晚的光，来源：云曦（100 瓦的心）。"
    sysvoice "System log, 23:14: tonight's problems, 100%% correct. Tonight's light source: Yunxi (a 100-watt heart)."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:306
translate english inter6_a9ee5958:

    # 我 "（小声）最后一句是你自己加的吧。"
    我 "(whispering) You added that last part yourself, didn't you."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:308
translate english inter6_afe13710:

    # 云曦 "证据确凿。反正停电，没人看见我脸红。……才没有。"
    云曦 "The evidence is conclusive. Anyway, the power was out-nobody saw me blush.... Not that I did."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:315
translate english inter6_bc937a11:

    # 知微 "好。……我明天，也在。"
    知微 "Okay.... Tomorrow, I'll be there too."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:316
translate english inter6_74401de3:

    # "她推了推眼镜，把「紧张」两个字藏进了一叠卷子后面。"
    "" "She pushes up her glasses and hides the word 'nervous' behind a stack of exam papers."

# game/scenes/interlude.rpy:320
translate english inter6_4b7ee815:

    # 云曦 "任务接受！加油音量：已调到最大。……放心，只对你一个人这么吵。"
    云曦 "Mission accepted! Cheering volume: set to maximum.... Relax. I'm only this loud for you."

translate english strings:

    old "{color=#fff4e0}『明天早读前，来社团。有东西给你。别问，问就是教具。』{/color}"
    new "{color=#fff4e0}'Before morning reading tomorrow, come to the club. I have something for you. Don't ask-if you ask, it's teaching equipment.'{/color}"

    old "下午放学，社团教室"
    new "Afternoon dismissal, the club room"

    old "开门先问「教具呢」"
    new "Open the door and immediately ask, 'Where's the teaching equipment'"

    old "先把奶糖剥开吃了"
    new "unwrap and eat the milk candy first"

    old "第二天，伞还回去了"
    new "The next day, the umbrella gets returned"

    old "伞柄上多了一副新手套"
    new "A new pair of gloves appears on the umbrella handle"

    old "在伞上贴了张便利贴：「谢谢，雨神」"
    new "Stick a note on the umbrella: 'Thank you, Rain God'"

    old "（第二天早上）"
    new "(the next morning)"

    old "装作什么都没听见"
    new "Pretend you heard nothing"

    old "把她的名字设成闹钟备注"
    new "Set her name as the alarm's label"

    old "「（用只有她俩能听见的音量）……两个都是吗？」"
    new "(In a voice only the two of them can hear) ...Both of them?"

    old "「装没听见，把话题岔回配速。」"
    new "Pretend not to hear it and change the subject back to pacing."

    old "{color=#fff4e0}『本班纪录：4 分 51 秒。瞬时速度峰值出现在最后 100 米。——数学社敬贺』{/color}"
    new "{color=#fff4e0}'Class record: 4:51. Peak instantaneous velocity in the final 100 meters. - Congratulations from the Math Club'{/color}"

    old "晚上，膝盖有点擦伤"
    new "Evening: a scraped knee"

    old "让社长帮忙上药"
    new "Let the president apply the medicine"

    old "让云曦用「医疗扫描」检查一遍"
    new "Have Yunxi run a 'medical scan'"

    old "放学路上，云曦小声说"
    new "On the way home from school, Yunxi says quietly"

    old "「其实两枚都是给我买的吧？」"
    new "'Actually both stars were bought for me, weren't they?'"

    old "把星星从书包上摘下来，收进内袋"
    new "Take the star off the backpack and keep it in the inner pocket"

    old "考前最后一晚，回家前"
    new "The last night before the exam, before heading home"

    old "对社长说「明天，等我的好消息」"
    new "Tell the president: 'Tomorrow-await my good news'"

    old "对云曦说「明天你负责在最后一排加油」"
    new "Tell Yunxi: 'Tomorrow, your job is cheering from the back row'"

